# skills: Focus. Jian at level 19 (level index 18 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple battle.
# Special lists Weapon Break, Armor Break, and Focus; Right moves to Focus (shot fc_list: "Focus", 6,
# "Attacks will not miss"). A casts it at once, with no picker: MP 50 -> 44, the battle-wide flags at the
# start of the battle work area (0x02282940 here) gain bit 4 (the Bealzebub card's "always hit" for the
# whole party), and the HIT banner shows on Jian (fc_cast). Next round the same pick is refused: the name
# bar says "No effect!" (fc_refused), the list stays up, and no MP is taken (one drop to 44 only).
# Not shown: an attack that would have missed now hitting. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 18
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
peek u32 0x020B8550 work
watch u32 0x0228e878 jian_mp
watch u32 0x02282940 battle_flags
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
shot fc_list
press A 8
wait 50
wait 20
shot fc_cast
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 600
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
shot fc_refused
wait 100
shot fc_after
